findings.comment:
750.800b - The following food contact surfaces were soiled with old food debris:
A) in-use fry baskets (side kitchen); 
B) pizza oven trays; 
C) inside microwave (side kitchen);
D) baking sheets inside warmer (main kitchen);
E) pizza slicer and knife at pizza ovens (left from previous day; old food debris);
F) trays inside pizza ovens; and
G) inside small ice machine (mold around baffle - top/sides of machine).
Clean and sanitize food contact surfaces between uses/as needed to prevent cross contamination and eliminate buildup of debris. In-use utensils and equipment (i.e. can opener, knives, pizza slicer, cutting boards, etc.) must be cleaned and sanitized up to every 4 hours.
